Manchester United Analysis Page
Overview & Purpose
Focuses on Manchester United's performance metrics, individual player contributions, shot efficiency, duel distributions by nationality/player, and age-category output.

Key Insights
Team Performance Totals: Produced 41 total goals and 297 total shots across 19K passes, sharing the 20 Premier League titles benchmark.

Key Playmaker: Bruno Fernandes stands out as the primary focal point, leading team Goal Contributions (29 G/A) and generating 18 G/A individually with 52 total shots.

Age Distribution Skew: Goal actions are overwhelmingly concentrated within the Prime age tier, dropping sharply across Veteran, Young, Experienced, and U20 categories.

Duel Distribution: Noussair Mazraoui accounts for the highest proportion of player duels (26.37% / 216 duels), followed by Bruno Fernandes (21.25% / 174 duels). Nationally, English and Portuguese players lead total team duels.
